# Key Business Insights

## Service-Level Performance

- OTIF performance achieved 47.66% against a target of 65.10%.
- On-Time performance reached 59.03% compared with an 85.24% target.
- In-Full performance was relatively stronger at 75.43%.

## Fulfillment Performance

- VOFR remained above 96%, indicating strong product availability.
- Delivery timeliness appears to be the primary driver of OTIF shortfalls.

## Customer Insights

- Customer-level service performance varies significantly.
- Several customers consistently exceed service targets while others require operational intervention.

## Recommendations

1. Improve delivery execution and route planning.
2. Focus on cities with the largest OTIF gaps.
3. Monitor customer-level service KPIs regularly.
4. Establish proactive alerts for service deterioration.
5. Investigate root causes of delayed deliveries.
